Your booking has been updated

Your booking with <%= @business.business_name %> has been updated.

Booking status:
<%= @booking.status.to_s.humanize %>

BOOKING DETAILS

Business: <%= @business.business_name %>
Service: <%= @service.name %>
Date: <%= @booking.date.strftime("%A, %d %B %Y") %>
Time: <%= @booking.time.strftime("%H:%M") %>
Service price: £<%= number_with_precision(@service.price || 0, precision: 2) %>

<% if (@booking.amount_paid || 0) > 0 && @booking.status.to_s != "completed" %>
  Amount paid: £<%= number_with_precision(@booking.amount_paid, precision: 2) %>
<% end %>

<% if @remaining_balance > 0 && @booking.status.to_s != "completed" %>
  Remaining balance: £<%= number_with_precision(@remaining_balance, precision: 2) %>
<% end %>

<% if @booking.status.to_s == "confirmed" %>
  Your appointment has been confirmed and is scheduled to go ahead at the date and time shown above.
<% elsif @booking.status.to_s == "cancelled" %>
  Your appointment has been cancelled and will no longer take place.
<% elsif @booking.status.to_s == "completed" %>
  Your appointment has been marked as completed.
<% else %>
  The status of your appointment has changed. Please review the booking details above.
<% end %>

